#
# /os-glossary/
#
# https://w3id.org/os-glossary/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://qtan-tran.github.io/open-science-glossary/
#
# Term pages keep their path: https://w3id.org/os-glossary/term/<slug>/
# -> https://qtan-tran.github.io/open-science-glossary/term/<slug>/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Quoc-Tan Tran
# GitHub username: qtan-tran
# ORCID: 0000-0003-3533-5858
#
RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://qtan-tran.github.io/open-science-glossary/$1 [R=302,L]
